				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$${V}_{c}\in {{\mathbb{R}}}_{+}$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M22"><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mi>V</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mi>c</mml:mi></mml:mrow></mml:msub><mml:mo>∈</mml:mo><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mi mathvariant="double-struck">R</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mo>+</mml:mo></mml:mrow></mml:msub></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq9.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq9.gif?><?image-size 383?><?image-md5 d18677a0a92fdbaba55faebc05946c84?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 29?><?image-scaled-width 59?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/d18677a0a92f/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq9.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq9.gif?><?thumb-size 383?><?thumb-md5 d18677a0a92fdbaba55faebc05946c84?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 29?><?thumb-scaled-width 59?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/d18677a0a92f/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq9.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula> is the critical volume and <inline-formula id="IEq10"><alternatives><tex-math id="M23"><?equation-image-name M23.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 910f38e47eeaf9952bb8d24cfa8e1913?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/910f38e47eea/M23.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$u\in \{0, 1\}$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M24"><mml:mi>u</mml:mi><mml:mo>∈</mml:mo><mml:mrow><mml:mo>{</mml:mo><mml:mrow><mml:mn>0</mml:mn><mml:mo>,</mml:mo><mml:mn>1</mml:mn></mml:mrow><mml:mo>}</mml:mo></mml:mrow></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq10.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq10.gif?><?image-size 2415?><?image-md5 bcd0c5473e0f5afdac67b3aeb500aecd?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 80?><?image-scaled-width 178?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/bcd0c5473e0f/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq10.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq10.gif?><?thumb-size 2415?><?thumb-md5 bcd0c5473e0f5afdac67b3aeb500aecd?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 80?><?thumb-scaled-width 178?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/bcd0c5473e0f/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq10.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula> is the external trigger input. The critical volume defines the minimum volume required to start the cell cycle, and it is also used to discern between mother (<inline-formula id="IEq11"><alternatives><tex-math id="M25"><?equation-image-name M25.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 9bc4cf0b2308b3541ab7a2e0af25d35f?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/9bc4cf0b2308/M25.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$V\ge {V}_{c}$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M26"><mml:mi>V</mml:mi><mml:mo>≥</mml:mo><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mi>V</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mi>c</mml:mi></mml:mrow></mml:msub></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq11.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq11.gif?><?image-size 285?><?image-md5 c8fd8db197cd9c1fb1b5cd6dc80e9958?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 29?><?image-scaled-width 53?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/c8fd8db197cd/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq11.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq11.gif?><?thumb-size 285?><?thumb-md5 c8fd8db197cd9c1fb1b5cd6dc80e9958?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 29?><?thumb-scaled-width 53?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/c8fd8db197cd/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq11.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula>) and daughter (<inline-formula id="IEq12"><alternatives><tex-math id="M27"><?equation-image-name M27.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 8b6199a2ae0f29a7e3de37929f06b748?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/8b6199a2ae0f/M27.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$0\le V &lt; {V}_{c}$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M28"><mml:mn>0</mml:mn><mml:mo>≤</mml:mo><mml:mi>V</mml:mi><mml:mo>&lt;</mml:mo><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mi>V</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mi>c</mml:mi></mml:mrow></mml:msub></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq12.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq12.gif?><?image-size 2516?><?image-md5 46b0251b80d072e1113f280a4bf5049d?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 71?><?image-scaled-width 200?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/46b0251b80d0/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq12.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq12.gif?><?thumb-size 2516?><?thumb-md5 46b0251b80d072e1113f280a4bf5049d?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 71?><?thumb-scaled-width 200?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/46b0251b80d0/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq12.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula>) cells. The external binary input represents the methionine-rich (<inline-formula id="IEq13"><alternatives><tex-math id="M29"><?equation-image-name M29.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 638563878f00b8ccc0781883ce24edfd?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/638563878f00/M29.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$u=0$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M30"><mml:mi>u</mml:mi><mml:mo>=</mml:mo><mml:mn>0</mml:mn></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq13.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq13.gif?><?image-size 248?><?image-md5 731ba9de6c448f10a074eb812fe0dd1b?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 29?><?image-scaled-width 42?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/731ba9de6c44/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq13.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq13.gif?><?thumb-size 248?><?thumb-md5 731ba9de6c448f10a074eb812fe0dd1b?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 29?><?thumb-scaled-width 42?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/731ba9de6c44/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq13.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula>) or methionine-depleted (<inline-formula id="IEq14"><alternatives><tex-math id="M31"><?equation-image-name M31.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 4ca98980be8b5c158f8130d42bd802d2?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/4ca98980be8b/M31.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$u=1$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M32"><mml:mi>u</mml:mi><mml:mo>=</mml:mo><mml:mn>1</mml:mn></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq14.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq14.gif?><?image-size 212?><?image-md5 fdf874379c867b798d4f11f10a48bbf3?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 29?><?image-scaled-width 42?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/fdf874379c86/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq14.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq14.gif?><?thumb-size 212?><?thumb-md5 fdf874379c867b798d4f11f10a48bbf3?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 29?><?thumb-scaled-width 42?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/fdf874379c86/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq14.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula>) growth medium. The phase-dependent switching function <inline-formula id="IEq15"><alternatives><tex-math id="M33"><?equation-image-name M33.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 005e431c12587c5f136cf62ca56a8b03?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/005e431c1258/M33.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$${g:}{{\mathbb{S}}}^{1}\to {{\mathbb{R}}}_{+}$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M34"><mml:mi>g</mml:mi><mml:mo>:</mml:mo><mml:msup><mml:mrow><mml:mi mathvariant="double-struck">S</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mn>1</mml:mn></mml:mrow></mml:msup><mml:mo>→</mml:mo><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mi mathvariant="double-struck">R</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mo>+</mml:mo></mml:mrow></mml:msub></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq15.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq15.gif?><?image-size 2318?><?image-md5 625070ee7823d05a6ed0d90ff5cb4a8a?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 80?><?image-scaled-width 192?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/625070ee7823/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq15.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq15.gif?><?thumb-size 2318?><?thumb-md5 625070ee7823d05a6ed0d90ff5cb4a8a?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 80?><?thumb-scaled-width 192?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/625070ee7823/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq15.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula> defines the cell volume growth rate during the G<sub>1</sub> phase:<disp-formula id="Equ3"><label>3</label><alternatives><tex-math id="M35"><?equation-image-name M35.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 094a4a12405661c8b7028b1f13fc6b6f?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/094a4a124056/M35.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$g\left( \vartheta \right)=\left\{\begin{array}{cc} \beta V &amp; {\rm{if}}\,0\le \vartheta &lt; {\vartheta }_{{G}_{1}/S}\\ 0 &amp; {\rm{if}}\,{\vartheta }_{{G}_{1}/S}\le \vartheta &lt; 2\pi \end{array},\right.$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M36"><mml:mi>g</mml:mi><mml:mfenced close=")" open="("><mml:mrow><mml:mi>ϑ</mml:mi></mml:mrow></mml:mfenced><mml:mo>=</mml:mo><mml:mfenced open="{"><mml:mrow><mml:mtable><mml:mtr><mml:mtd columnalign="center"><mml:mi>β</mml:mi><mml:mi>V</mml:mi></mml:mtd><mml:mtd columnalign="center"><mml:mi mathvariant="normal">if</mml:mi><mml:mspace width="0.25em"/><mml:mn>0</mml:mn><mml:mo>≤</mml:mo><mml:mi>ϑ</mml:mi><mml:mo>&lt;</mml:mo><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mi>ϑ</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mi>G</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mn>1</mml:mn></mml:mrow></mml:msub><mml:mo>/</mml:mo><mml:mi>S</mml:mi></mml:mrow></mml:msub></mml:mtd></mml:mtr><mml:mtr><mml:mtd columnalign="center"><mml:mn>0</mml:mn></mml:mtd><mml:mtd columnalign="center"><mml:mi mathvariant="normal">if</mml:mi><mml:mspace width="0.25em"/><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mi>ϑ</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mi>G</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mn>1</mml:mn></mml:mrow></mml:msub><mml:mo>/</mml:mo><mml:mi>S</mml:mi></mml:mrow></mml:msub><mml:mo>≤</mml:mo><mml:mi>ϑ</mml:mi><mml:mo>&lt;</mml:mo><mml:mn>2</mml:mn><mml:mi>π</mml:mi></mml:mtd></mml:mtr></mml:mtable><mml:mo>,</mml:mo></mml:mrow></mml:mfenced></mml:math><graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" position="anchor" orientation="portrait" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_Equ3.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_Equ3.gif?><?image-size 2629?><?image-md5 804f4f8bfc658f84d209bc87d751adca?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 50?><?image-scaled-width 200?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/804f4f8bfc65/41467_2021_22689_Article_Equ3.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_Equ3.gif?><?thumb-size 2629?><?thumb-md5 804f4f8bfc658f84d209bc87d751adca?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 50?><?thumb-scaled-width 200?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/804f4f8bfc65/41467_2021_22689_Article_Equ3.gif?></graphic></alternatives></disp-formula>where <inline-formula id="IEq16"><alternatives><tex-math id="M37"><?equation-image-name M37.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 eb9648c7c2e64c832d916a16ffab9035?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/eb9648c7c2e6/M37.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$\beta \in {{\mathbb{R}}}_{+}$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M38"><mml:mi>β</mml:mi><mml:mo>∈</mml:mo><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mi mathvariant="double-struck">R</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mo>+</mml:mo></mml:mrow></mml:msub></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq16.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq16.gif?><?image-size 317?><?image-md5 6d88f7650ff27b82f59488597d9fc453?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 29?><?image-scaled-width 51?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/6d88f7650ff2/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq16.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq16.gif?><?thumb-size 317?><?thumb-md5 6d88f7650ff27b82f59488597d9fc453?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 29?><?thumb-scaled-width 51?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/6d88f7650ff2/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq16.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula> is the volume growth rate and <inline-formula id="IEq17"><alternatives><tex-math id="M39"><?equation-image-name M39.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 b48c5955849d6362410acefbadee670c?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/b48c5955849d/M39.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$${\vartheta }_{{G}_{1}/S}$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M40"><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mi>ϑ</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mi>G</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mn>1</mml:mn></mml:mrow></mml:msub><mml:mo>/</mml:mo><mml:mi>S</mml:mi></mml:mrow></mml:msub></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq17.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq17.gif?><?image-size 288?><?image-md5 f706a79a6991631838947570c08bab0d?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 29?><?image-scaled-width 42?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/f706a79a6991/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq17.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq17.gif?><?thumb-size 288?><?thumb-md5 f706a79a6991631838947570c08bab0d?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 29?><?thumb-scaled-width 42?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/f706a79a6991/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq17.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula> is the cell cycle phase value at the G<sub>1</sub> to S transition. We assumed that cell’s volume grows exponentially only during the G<sub>1</sub> phase, thus neglecting the mass generated during the other phases (i.e. S-G<sub>2</sub>-M), most of which is transferred to the growing bud<sup><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="CR31">31</xref></sup>. The phase-dependent switching function <inline-formula id="IEq18"><alternatives><tex-math id="M41"><?equation-image-name M41.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 480d1212eed95d940d0c674d735f8a0d?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/480d1212eed9/M41.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$${f:}{{\mathbb{S}}}^{1}\to {{\mathbb{R}}}_{+}$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M42"><mml:mi>f</mml:mi><mml:mo>:</mml:mo><mml:msup><mml:mrow><mml:mi mathvariant="double-struck">S</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mn>1</mml:mn></mml:mrow></mml:msup><mml:mo>→</mml:mo><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mi mathvariant="double-struck">R</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mo>+</mml:mo></mml:mrow></mml:msub></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq18.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq18.gif?><?image-size 2340?><?image-md5 334bcabbf68ee3928ad37a4dda72c9f2?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 80?><?image-scaled-width 194?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/334bcabbf68e/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq18.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq18.gif?><?thumb-size 2340?><?thumb-md5 334bcabbf68ee3928ad37a4dda72c9f2?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 80?><?thumb-scaled-width 194?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/334bcabbf68e/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq18.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula> models the phase oscillator dynamics. The function <inline-formula id="IEq19"><alternatives><tex-math id="M43"><?equation-image-name M43.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 69d7c06a524433c64fbbfb6d101ff90a?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/69d7c06a5244/M43.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$f$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M44"><mml:mi>f</mml:mi></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq19.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq19.gif?><?image-size 151?><?image-md5 284eaa3ade7d568fa21f150b6629477e?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 29?><?image-scaled-width 14?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/284eaa3ade7d/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq19.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq19.gif?><?thumb-size 151?><?thumb-md5 284eaa3ade7d568fa21f150b6629477e?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 29?><?thumb-scaled-width 14?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/284eaa3ade7d/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq19.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula> changes according to the specific strain. For the non-cycling strain, the function <inline-formula id="IEq20"><alternatives><tex-math id="M45"><?equation-image-name M45.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 87cdb050f672d2873038734e3010c435?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/87cdb050f672/M45.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$f:= {f}_{{nc}}$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M46"><mml:mi>f</mml:mi><mml:mo>:</mml:mo><mml:mo>=</mml:mo><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mi>f</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mi>n</mml:mi><mml:mi>c</mml:mi></mml:mrow></mml:msub></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq20.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq20.gif?><?image-size 292?><?image-md5 e6c0703d5dcffc68eda54b1639ec28b0?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 29?><?image-scaled-width 58?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/e6c0703d5dcf/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq20.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq20.gif?><?thumb-size 292?><?thumb-md5 e6c0703d5dcffc68eda54b1639ec28b0?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 29?><?thumb-scaled-width 58?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/e6c0703d5dcf/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq20.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula> is state-dependent:<disp-formula id="Equ4"><label>4</label><alternatives><tex-math id="M47"><?equation-image-name M47.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 eb588e60b29307714b2745c02671e48a?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/eb588e60b293/M47.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$${f}_{{nc}}\left(\vartheta \right)=\left\{\begin{array}{cc}0 &amp; {\rm{if}}\,0\le \vartheta &lt; {\vartheta }_{{G}_{1}/S}\\ \omega &amp; {\rm{if}}\,{\vartheta }_{{G}_{1}/S}\le \vartheta &lt; 2\pi \end{array},\right.$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M48"><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mi>f</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mi>n</mml:mi><mml:mi>c</mml:mi></mml:mrow></mml:msub><mml:mfenced close=")" open="("><mml:mrow><mml:mi>ϑ</mml:mi></mml:mrow></mml:mfenced><mml:mo>=</mml:mo><mml:mfenced open="{"><mml:mrow><mml:mtable><mml:mtr><mml:mtd columnalign="center"><mml:mn>0</mml:mn></mml:mtd><mml:mtd columnalign="center"><mml:mi mathvariant="normal">if</mml:mi><mml:mspace width="0.25em"/><mml:mn>0</mml:mn><mml:mo>≤</mml:mo><mml:mi>ϑ</mml:mi><mml:mo>&lt;</mml:mo><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mi>ϑ</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mi>G</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mn>1</mml:mn></mml:mrow></mml:msub><mml:mo>/</mml:mo><mml:mi>S</mml:mi></mml:mrow></mml:msub></mml:mtd></mml:mtr><mml:mtr><mml:mtd columnalign="center"><mml:mi>ω</mml:mi></mml:mtd><mml:mtd columnalign="center"><mml:mi mathvariant="normal">if</mml:mi><mml:mspace width="0.25em"/><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mi>ϑ</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mi>G</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mn>1</mml:mn></mml:mrow></mml:msub><mml:mo>/</mml:mo><mml:mi>S</mml:mi></mml:mrow></mml:msub><mml:mo>≤</mml:mo><mml:mi>ϑ</mml:mi><mml:mo>&lt;</mml:mo><mml:mn>2</mml:mn><mml:mi>π</mml:mi></mml:mtd></mml:mtr></mml:mtable><mml:mo>,</mml:mo></mml:mrow></mml:mfenced></mml:math><graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" position="anchor" orientation="portrait" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_Equ4.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_Equ4.gif?><?image-size 2535?><?image-md5 1c0888e67e099afa6fbb37244d7e56b5?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 49?><?image-scaled-width 200?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/1c0888e67e09/41467_2021_22689_Article_Equ4.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_Equ4.gif?><?thumb-size 2535?><?thumb-md5 1c0888e67e099afa6fbb37244d7e56b5?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 49?><?thumb-scaled-width 200?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/1c0888e67e09/41467_2021_22689_Article_Equ4.gif?></graphic></alternatives></disp-formula>where <inline-formula id="IEq21"><alternatives><tex-math id="M49"><?equation-image-name M49.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 20835d2b38c5d13a774f46c6b42dd041?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/20835d2b38c5/M49.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$\omega =\frac{2\pi }{T}$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M50"><mml:mi>ω</mml:mi><mml:mo>=</mml:mo><mml:mfrac><mml:mrow><mml:mn>2</mml:mn><mml:mi>π</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mi>T</mml:mi></mml:mrow></mml:mfrac></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq21.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq21.gif?><?image-size 289?><?image-md5 e7e128bef0934a735cd7c71d2171db08?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 36?><?image-scaled-width 51?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/e7e128bef093/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq21.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq21.gif?><?thumb-size 289?><?thumb-md5 e7e128bef0934a735cd7c71d2171db08?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 36?><?thumb-scaled-width 51?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/e7e128bef093/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq21.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula> is the angular velocity depending on the cell cycle period <inline-formula id="IEq22"><alternatives><tex-math id="M51"><?equation-image-name M51.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 2608698f928fc32d292702cb3d32b89f?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/2608698f928f/M51.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$T$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M52"><mml:mi>T</mml:mi></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq22.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq22.gif?><?image-size 145?><?image-md5 1f624083de5cfdd53dd0faa750fdcb74?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 15?><?image-scaled-width 16?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/1f624083de5c/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq22.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq22.gif?><?thumb-size 145?><?thumb-md5 1f624083de5cfdd53dd0faa750fdcb74?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 15?><?thumb-scaled-width 16?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/1f624083de5c/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq22.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula>. For the cycling strain, the function <inline-formula id="IEq23"><alternatives><tex-math id="M53"><?equation-image-name M53.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 f890466b84481f55b28df1a6a05ea75a?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/f890466b8448/M53.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$f:= {f}_{c}$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M54"><mml:mi>f</mml:mi><mml:mo>:</mml:mo><mml:mo>=</mml:mo><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mi>f</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mi>c</mml:mi></mml:mrow></mml:msub></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq23.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq23.gif?><?image-size 266?><?image-md5 7811162cb29d848fe248b39cf81d8d94?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 29?><?image-scaled-width 52?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/7811162cb29d/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq23.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq23.gif?><?thumb-size 266?><?thumb-md5 7811162cb29d848fe248b39cf81d8d94?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 29?><?thumb-scaled-width 52?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/7811162cb29d/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq23.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula> becomes state-independent:<disp-formula id="Equ5"><label>5</label><alternatives><tex-math id="M55"><?equation-image-name M55.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 f6b807ea286e7585ee692375639cec95?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/f6b807ea286e/M55.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
