				\begin{document}$${V}_{c}$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M100"><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mi>V</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mi>c</mml:mi></mml:mrow></mml:msub></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq44.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq44.gif?><?image-size 183?><?image-md5 fa880775ac55ca4296059db307ff29c3?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 29?><?image-scaled-width 20?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/fa880775ac55/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq44.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq44.gif?><?thumb-size 183?><?thumb-md5 fa880775ac55ca4296059db307ff29c3?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 29?><?thumb-scaled-width 20?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/fa880775ac55/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq44.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula>. The agent-based system was solved using the MATLAB <italic toggle="yes">ode15s</italic> solver. All plots were generated in MATLAB. The code to run all the simulations and the model is available at <ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="https://github.com/dibbelab/Cycloop/tree/main/Simulator">https://github.com/dibbelab/Cycloop/tree/main/Simulator</ext-link>.</p></sec><sec id="Sec13"><title>Phase estimation and budding index</title><p id="Par44">For the non-cycling strain, the cell cycle phase <inline-formula id="IEq45"><alternatives><tex-math id="M101"><?equation-image-name M101.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 db7e79e20cc40d63ad604be2b8a98c86?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/db7e79e20cc4/M101.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
