				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$\vartheta \in [{\mathrm{0,2}} \pi ]$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M102"><mml:mi>ϑ</mml:mi><mml:mo>∈</mml:mo><mml:mrow><mml:mo>[</mml:mo><mml:mrow><mml:mi mathvariant="normal">0, 2</mml:mi><mml:mi>π</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mo>]</mml:mo></mml:mrow></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq45.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq45.gif?><?image-size 2919?><?image-md5 956605a9e762db8917363c925ca56eb9?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 74?><?image-scaled-width 200?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/956605a9e762/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq45.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq45.gif?><?thumb-size 2919?><?thumb-md5 956605a9e762db8917363c925ca56eb9?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 74?><?thumb-scaled-width 200?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/956605a9e762/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq45.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula> was estimated by comparing the single-cell <italic toggle="yes">CLN2-YFP</italic> trace with a periodic reference signal. The periodic reference signal <inline-formula id="IEq46"><alternatives><tex-math id="M103"><?equation-image-name M103.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 214ea3873bbfc73c7c829781a025ef68?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/214ea3873bbf/M103.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
