				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$${\rm{CLN}}{2}_{{\rm{ref}}}$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M104"><mml:mi mathvariant="normal">CLN</mml:mi><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mn>2</mml:mn></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mi mathvariant="normal">ref</mml:mi></mml:mrow></mml:msub></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq46.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq46.gif?><?image-size 2796?><?image-md5 e53a125ef4cb2170d82cf254c93f9dd6?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 80?><?image-scaled-width 168?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/e53a125ef4cb/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq46.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq46.gif?><?thumb-size 2796?><?thumb-md5 e53a125ef4cb2170d82cf254c93f9dd6?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 80?><?thumb-scaled-width 168?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/e53a125ef4cb/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq46.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula> was constructed according to the dynamical expression of the essential G<sub>1</sub> cycling gene <italic toggle="yes">CLN2</italic> in the non-cycling strain:<disp-formula id="Equ7"><label>7</label><alternatives><tex-math id="M105"><?equation-image-name M105.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 51b619fcb8b18f65b17288f20f3bff60?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/51b619fcb8b1/M105.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
