				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$r$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M118"><mml:mi>r</mml:mi></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq52.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq52.gif?><?image-size 118?><?image-md5 9048300591d1fe5bc999ef7cad2c09e4?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 15?><?image-scaled-width 11?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/9048300591d1/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq52.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq52.gif?><?thumb-size 118?><?thumb-md5 9048300591d1fe5bc999ef7cad2c09e4?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 15?><?thumb-scaled-width 11?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/9048300591d1/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq52.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula>. Specifically, the last part (duration equals to <inline-formula id="IEq53"><alternatives><tex-math id="M119"><?equation-image-name M119.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 2014ddeed5378283d1388b49d376611a?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/2014ddeed537/M119.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$${T}_{{{\rm{flat}}}}$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M120"><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mi>T</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mi mathvariant="normal">flat</mml:mi></mml:mrow></mml:msub></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq53.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq53.gif?><?image-size 287?><?image-md5 95b39a108a197eca77fc9b509bf2aa9b?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 29?><?image-scaled-width 30?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/95b39a108a19/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq53.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq53.gif?><?thumb-size 287?><?thumb-md5 95b39a108a197eca77fc9b509bf2aa9b?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 29?><?thumb-scaled-width 30?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/95b39a108a19/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq53.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula>) of the measured fluorescence signal <inline-formula id="IEq54"><alternatives><tex-math id="M121"><?equation-image-name M121.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 c3bb51c4247da3672196657584f7ddd9?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/c3bb51c4247d/M121.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$${\rm{CLN}}{2}_{[{\rm{t}}-{{\rm{T}}}_{{\rm{flat}}},{\rm{t}}]}$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M122"><mml:mi mathvariant="normal">CLN</mml:mi><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mn>2</mml:mn></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mo>[</mml:mo><mml:mrow><mml:mi mathvariant="normal">t</mml:mi><mml:mo>−</mml:mo><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mi mathvariant="normal">T</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mi mathvariant="normal">flat</mml:mi></mml:mrow></mml:msub><mml:mo>,</mml:mo><mml:mi mathvariant="normal">t</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mo>]</mml:mo></mml:mrow></mml:mrow></mml:msub></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq54.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq54.gif?><?image-size 2821?><?image-md5 f3f64c9d97c1e0212136af4264666516?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 62?><?image-scaled-width 200?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/f3f64c9d97c1/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq54.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq54.gif?><?thumb-size 2821?><?thumb-md5 f3f64c9d97c1e0212136af4264666516?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 62?><?thumb-scaled-width 200?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/f3f64c9d97c1/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq54.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula> was cross-correlated with the periodic reference signal using a shifting time window in the interval <inline-formula id="IEq55"><alternatives><tex-math id="M123"><?equation-image-name M123.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 6bf700c28e423de53b54a6611df86856?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/6bf700c28e42/M123.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$[\tau -{T}_{{{\rm{flat}}}},\tau ]$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M124"><mml:mrow><mml:mo>[</mml:mo><mml:mrow><mml:mi>τ</mml:mi><mml:mo>−</mml:mo><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mi>T</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mi mathvariant="normal">flat</mml:mi></mml:mrow></mml:msub><mml:mo>,</mml:mo><mml:mi>τ</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mo>]</mml:mo></mml:mrow></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq55.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq55.gif?><?image-size 2367?><?image-md5 513dbfbd2d19fcd890855effe8da2bfa?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 69?><?image-scaled-width 200?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/513dbfbd2d19/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq55.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq55.gif?><?thumb-size 2367?><?thumb-md5 513dbfbd2d19fcd890855effe8da2bfa?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 69?><?thumb-scaled-width 200?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/513dbfbd2d19/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq55.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula>, where <inline-formula id="IEq56"><alternatives><tex-math id="M125"><?equation-image-name M125.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 66225a364570a78521bf712f6257502c?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/66225a364570/M125.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$\tau \in [{T}_{{{\rm{flat}}}},T]$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M126"><mml:mi>τ</mml:mi><mml:mo>∈</mml:mo><mml:mrow><mml:mo>[</mml:mo><mml:mrow><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mi>T</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mi mathvariant="normal">flat</mml:mi></mml:mrow></mml:msub><mml:mo>,</mml:mo><mml:mi>T</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mo>]</mml:mo></mml:mrow></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq56.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq56.gif?><?image-size 2602?><?image-md5 4804f0f69ccd1de0550103c2fdd7522a?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 67?><?image-scaled-width 200?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/4804f0f69ccd/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq56.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq56.gif?><?thumb-size 2602?><?thumb-md5 4804f0f69ccd1de0550103c2fdd7522a?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 67?><?thumb-scaled-width 200?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/4804f0f69ccd/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq56.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula>. The time point <inline-formula id="IEq57"><alternatives><tex-math id="M127"><?equation-image-name M127.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 61c6e424cbc52b73d04dbe218660fc2f?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/61c6e424cbc5/M127.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$\tau$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M128"><mml:mi>τ</mml:mi></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq57.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq57.gif?><?image-size 130?><?image-md5 c905e61b922afeb970ad489c49683425?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 29?><?image-scaled-width 12?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/c905e61b922a/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq57.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq57.gif?><?thumb-size 130?><?thumb-md5 c905e61b922afeb970ad489c49683425?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 29?><?thumb-scaled-width 12?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/c905e61b922a/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq57.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula> at which <inline-formula id="IEq58"><alternatives><tex-math id="M129"><?equation-image-name M129.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 0a33f142b04d4b3cd850a4b1bf7f5fde?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/0a33f142b04d/M129.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$r$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M130"><mml:mi>r</mml:mi></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq58.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq58.gif?><?image-size 118?><?image-md5 9048300591d1fe5bc999ef7cad2c09e4?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 15?><?image-scaled-width 11?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/9048300591d1/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq58.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq58.gif?><?thumb-size 118?><?thumb-md5 9048300591d1fe5bc999ef7cad2c09e4?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 15?><?thumb-scaled-width 11?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/9048300591d1/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq58.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula> reached the maximum value was used as a time-reference to estimate the cell cycle phase <inline-formula id="IEq59"><alternatives><tex-math id="M131"><?equation-image-name M131.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 e4cdf98b29702f18c1bb63c2d18c0cb5?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/e4cdf98b2970/M131.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$\hat{\vartheta }$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M132"><mml:mover accent="true"><mml:mrow><mml:mi>ϑ</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mo>^</mml:mo></mml:mrow></mml:mover></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq59.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq59.gif?><?image-size 239?><?image-md5 bfa9e91083b8a802c67f0ec0576acc4c?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 37?><?image-scaled-width 14?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/bfa9e91083b8/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq59.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq59.gif?><?thumb-size 239?><?thumb-md5 bfa9e91083b8a802c67f0ec0576acc4c?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 37?><?thumb-scaled-width 14?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/bfa9e91083b8/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq59.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula> using the linear relationship:<disp-formula id="Equ8"><label>8</label><alternatives><tex-math id="M133"><?equation-image-name M133.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 2d8ff8f221537dcb9fcf4c1e3c8b233b?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/2d8ff8f22153/M133.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$\begin{array}{c}\hat{\vartheta }=\frac{2\pi }{{T}_{0}}\times \left(\tau -{T}_{{{\rm{flat}}}}\right)+\frac{\pi }{2},\end{array}$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M134"><mml:mtable><mml:mtr><mml:mtd columnalign="center"><mml:mover accent="true"><mml:mrow><mml:mi>ϑ</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mo>^</mml:mo></mml:mrow></mml:mover><mml:mo>=</mml:mo><mml:mfrac><mml:mrow><mml:mn>2</mml:mn><mml:mi>π</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mi>T</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mn>0</mml:mn></mml:mrow></mml:msub></mml:mrow></mml:mfrac><mml:mo>×</mml:mo><mml:mfenced close=")" open="("><mml:mrow><mml:mi>τ</mml:mi><mml:mo>−</mml:mo><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mi>T</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mi mathvariant="normal">flat</mml:mi></mml:mrow></mml:msub></mml:mrow></mml:mfenced><mml:mo>+</mml:mo><mml:mfrac><mml:mrow><mml:mi>π</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mn>2</mml:mn></mml:mrow></mml:mfrac><mml:mo>,</mml:mo></mml:mtd></mml:mtr></mml:mtable></mml:math><graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" position="anchor" orientation="portrait" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_Equ8.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_Equ8.gif?><?image-size 816?><?image-md5 4d911e7486b318c14ba5cdc399ea8d21?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 39?><?image-scaled-width 174?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/4d911e7486b3/41467_2021_22689_Article_Equ8.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_Equ8.gif?><?thumb-size 816?><?thumb-md5 4d911e7486b318c14ba5cdc399ea8d21?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 39?><?thumb-scaled-width 174?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/4d911e7486b3/41467_2021_22689_Article_Equ8.gif?></graphic></alternatives></disp-formula>where <inline-formula id="IEq60"><alternatives><tex-math id="M135"><?equation-image-name M135.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 ff0a2d0d90eaa4fe9e06b19b05dbaf0b?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/ff0a2d0d90ea/M135.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$\hat{\vartheta }=0$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M136"><mml:mover accent="true"><mml:mrow><mml:mi>ϑ</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mo>^</mml:mo></mml:mrow></mml:mover><mml:mo>=</mml:mo><mml:mn>0</mml:mn></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq60.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq60.gif?><?image-size 342?><?image-md5 428f09aab6526c02bfe9bf6b65314532?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 37?><?image-scaled-width 43?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/428f09aab652/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq60.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq60.gif?><?thumb-size 342?><?thumb-md5 428f09aab6526c02bfe9bf6b65314532?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 37?><?thumb-scaled-width 43?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/428f09aab652/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq60.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula> means that the cell is at the M/G<sub>1</sub> transition. Pearson’s correlation coefficient was computed using the MATLAB function <italic toggle="yes">corr</italic>. The nominal cell-cycle period <inline-formula id="IEq61"><alternatives><tex-math id="M137"><?equation-image-name M137.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 c1ac16dc902e9e919192abf8a0dad3ef?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/c1ac16dc902e/M137.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$${T}_{0}$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M138"><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mi>T</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mn>0</mml:mn></mml:mrow></mml:msub></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq61.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq61.gif?><?image-size 194?><?image-md5 2e5d716b6cf38638afbcec9601113364?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 29?><?image-scaled-width 21?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/2e5d716b6cf3/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq61.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq61.gif?><?thumb-size 194?><?thumb-md5 2e5d716b6cf38638afbcec9601113364?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 29?><?thumb-scaled-width 21?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/2e5d716b6cf3/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq61.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula> was set to 75 min, i.e. the duration of the cell cycle period in the non-cycling strain<sup><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="CR36">36</xref></sup>; while the time period <inline-formula id="IEq62"><alternatives><tex-math id="M139"><?equation-image-name M139.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 2014ddeed5378283d1388b49d376611a?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/2014ddeed537/M139.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$${T}_{{{\rm{flat}}}}$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M140"><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mi>T</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mi mathvariant="normal">flat</mml:mi></mml:mrow></mml:msub></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq62.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq62.gif?><?image-size 287?><?image-md5 95b39a108a197eca77fc9b509bf2aa9b?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 29?><?image-scaled-width 30?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/95b39a108a19/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq62.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq62.gif?><?thumb-size 287?><?thumb-md5 95b39a108a197eca77fc9b509bf2aa9b?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 29?><?thumb-scaled-width 30?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/95b39a108a19/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq62.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula> was set to 30 min, according to the length of the measured fluorescence signal used to evaluate the cross-correlation. The length of the G<sub>1</sub> phase was set to 25% of the nominal cell cycle period<sup><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="CR45">45</xref></sup>.</p><p id="Par45">For the cycling strain, the cell cycle phase <inline-formula id="IEq63"><alternatives><tex-math id="M141"><?equation-image-name M141.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 db7e79e20cc40d63ad604be2b8a98c86?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/db7e79e20cc4/M141.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$\vartheta \in [{\mathrm{0,2}}\pi ]$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M142"><mml:mi>ϑ</mml:mi><mml:mo>∈</mml:mo><mml:mrow><mml:mo>[</mml:mo><mml:mrow><mml:mi mathvariant="normal">0, 2</mml:mi><mml:mi>π</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mo>]</mml:mo></mml:mrow></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq63.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq63.gif?><?image-size 2919?><?image-md5 956605a9e762db8917363c925ca56eb9?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 74?><?image-scaled-width 200?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/956605a9e762/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq63.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq63.gif?><?thumb-size 2919?><?thumb-md5 956605a9e762db8917363c925ca56eb9?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 74?><?thumb-scaled-width 200?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/956605a9e762/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq63.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula> was estimated from the single-cell <italic toggle="yes">CDC10-YFP</italic> trace using a custom procedure. The single-cell fluorescence signal was firstly binarized according to the dynamical expression of the septine protein Cdc10. Indeed, the septine protein Cdc10 contributes to form the ring at the interface between the mother and the daughter cell (i.e. the bud)<sup><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="CR46">46</xref></sup>. Thus, the fluorescence signal is linked to the bud formation and so is detected only during the budded phase (i.e. S-G<sub>2</sub>-M phases). In the ideal case, the fluorescence signal is binary (on/off). To binarize the single-cell fluorescence trace at the sampling time <inline-formula id="IEq64"><alternatives><tex-math id="M143"><?equation-image-name M143.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 391609a27f82f32ab01d56e0381b9eaa?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/391609a27f82/M143.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$t$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M144"><mml:mi>t</mml:mi></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq64.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq64.gif?><?image-size 127?><?image-md5 a9ec1de4f07d4138723851503cd41823?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 29?><?image-scaled-width 9?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/a9ec1de4f07d/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq64.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq64.gif?><?thumb-size 127?><?thumb-md5 a9ec1de4f07d4138723851503cd41823?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 29?><?thumb-scaled-width 9?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/a9ec1de4f07d/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq64.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula>, the raw Cdc10-YFP signal was coarsely smoothed with a moving average filter with window size of 5 samples and then filtered again with a finer 3 samples window filter. Then, the filtered fluorescence signal was transformed in a binary signal using the threshold value <inline-formula id="IEq65"><alternatives><tex-math id="M145"><?equation-image-name M145.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 47995a843c0be1f8bbab5f3153aa65f7?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/47995a843c0b/M145.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$l(t)$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M146"><mml:mi>l</mml:mi><mml:mrow><mml:mo>(</mml:mo><mml:mrow><mml:mi>t</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mo>)</mml:mo></mml:mrow></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq65.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq65.gif?><?image-size 244?><?image-md5 50549bcb563f203ea17444662bbbd66f?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 29?><?image-scaled-width 25?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/50549bcb563f/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq65.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq65.gif?><?thumb-size 244?><?thumb-md5 50549bcb563f203ea17444662bbbd66f?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 29?><?thumb-scaled-width 25?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/50549bcb563f/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq65.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula>:<disp-formula id="Equ9"><label>9</label><alternatives><tex-math id="M147"><?equation-image-name M147.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 27f2a26f1aa04205d4efbf1096a24777?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/27f2a26f1aa0/M147.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$f\left(x\left(t\right)\right)=\left\{\begin{array}{cc}0 &amp; {\rm{if}}\,x\left(t\right) &lt; l\left(t\right)\\ 1 &amp; {\rm{if}}\,x\left(t\right)\ge l\left(t\right)\end{array}\right.,$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M148"><mml:mi>f</mml:mi><mml:mfenced close=")" open="("><mml:mrow><mml:mi>x</mml:mi><mml:mfenced close=")" open="("><mml:mrow><mml:mi>t</mml:mi></mml:mrow></mml:mfenced></mml:mrow></mml:mfenced><mml:mo>=</mml:mo><mml:mfenced open="{"><mml:mrow><mml:mtable><mml:mtr><mml:mtd columnalign="center"><mml:mn>0</mml:mn></mml:mtd><mml:mtd columnalign="center"><mml:mi mathvariant="normal">if</mml:mi><mml:mspace width="0.25em"/><mml:mi>x</mml:mi><mml:mfenced close=")" open="("><mml:mrow><mml:mi>t</mml:mi></mml:mrow></mml:mfenced><mml:mo>&lt;</mml:mo><mml:mi>l</mml:mi><mml:mfenced close=")" open="("><mml:mrow><mml:mi>t</mml:mi></mml:mrow></mml:mfenced></mml:mtd></mml:mtr><mml:mtr><mml:mtd columnalign="center"><mml:mn>1</mml:mn></mml:mtd><mml:mtd columnalign="center"><mml:mi mathvariant="normal">if</mml:mi><mml:mspace width="0.25em"/><mml:mi>x</mml:mi><mml:mfenced close=")" open="("><mml:mrow><mml:mi>t</mml:mi></mml:mrow></mml:mfenced><mml:mo>≥</mml:mo><mml:mi>l</mml:mi><mml:mfenced close=")" open="("><mml:mrow><mml:mi>t</mml:mi></mml:mrow></mml:mfenced></mml:mtd></mml:mtr></mml:mtable></mml:mrow></mml:mfenced><mml:mo>,</mml:mo></mml:math><graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" position="anchor" orientation="portrait" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_Equ9.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_Equ9.gif?><?image-size 2704?><?image-md5 46986ea9a86a6c8e76f525c6d2ca38e5?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 56?><?image-scaled-width 200?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/46986ea9a86a/41467_2021_22689_Article_Equ9.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_Equ9.gif?><?thumb-size 2704?><?thumb-md5 46986ea9a86a6c8e76f525c6d2ca38e5?><?thumb-