				\begin{document}$$x$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M150"><mml:mi>x</mml:mi></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq66.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq66.gif?><?image-size 139?><?image-md5 06e7a3aab2c0964f06b63a8970eb4186?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 29?><?image-scaled-width 13?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/06e7a3aab2c0/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq66.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq66.gif?><?thumb-size 139?><?thumb-md5 06e7a3aab2c0964f06b63a8970eb4186?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 29?><?thumb-scaled-width 13?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/06e7a3aab2c0/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq66.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula> is the filtered fluorescence value, and <inline-formula id="IEq67"><alternatives><tex-math id="M151"><?equation-image-name M151.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 0c895e9af837bba7a4c675145828013c?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/0c895e9af837/M151.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
