				\begin{document}$$l$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M152"><mml:mi>l</mml:mi></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq67.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq67.gif?><?image-size 129?><?image-md5 f7ebc8c41dab5e0114526de557568180?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 29?><?image-scaled-width 9?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/f7ebc8c41dab/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq67.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq67.gif?><?thumb-size 129?><?thumb-md5 f7ebc8c41dab5e0114526de557568180?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 29?><?thumb-scaled-width 9?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/f7ebc8c41dab/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq67.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula> is the threshold value; both evaluated at time <inline-formula id="IEq68"><alternatives><tex-math id="M153"><?equation-image-name M153.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 391609a27f82f32ab01d56e0381b9eaa?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/391609a27f82/M153.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
