				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$f\left(x\right)=0$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M156"><mml:mi>f</mml:mi><mml:mfenced close=")" open="("><mml:mrow><mml:mi>x</mml:mi></mml:mrow></mml:mfenced><mml:mo>=</mml:mo><mml:mn>0</mml:mn></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq69.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq69.gif?><?image-size 2573?><?image-md5 1250993f6de443c3a59c40db24542109?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 80?><?image-scaled-width 182?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/1250993f6de4/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq69.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq69.gif?><?thumb-size 2573?><?thumb-md5 1250993f6de443c3a59c40db24542109?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 80?><?thumb-scaled-width 182?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/1250993f6de4/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq69.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula> means that the cell is in the off state, i.e. the unbudded phase; while <inline-formula id="IEq70"><alternatives><tex-math id="M157"><?equation-image-name M157.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 53a865b4bbcb1e6a4b9cd26d901c009b?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/53a865b4bbcb/M157.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$f\left(x\right)=1$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M158"><mml:mi>f</mml:mi><mml:mfenced close=")" open="("><mml:mrow><mml:mi>x</mml:mi></mml:mrow></mml:mfenced><mml:mo>=</mml:mo><mml:mn>1</mml:mn></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq70.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq70.gif?><?image-size 2310?><?image-md5 42cfcfba895fed66af721a8da6228100?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 80?><?image-scaled-width 182?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/42cfcfba895f/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq70.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq70.gif?><?thumb-size 2310?><?thumb-md5 42cfcfba895fed66af721a8da6228100?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 80?><?thumb-scaled-width 182?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/42cfcfba895f/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq70.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula> means that the cell is in the on state, i.e. the budded phase. The threshold value <inline-formula id="IEq71"><alternatives><tex-math id="M159"><?equation-image-name M159.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 0c895e9af837bba7a4c675145828013c?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/0c895e9af837/M159.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$l$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M160"><mml:mi>l</mml:mi></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq71.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq71.gif?><?image-size 129?><?image-md5 f7ebc8c41dab5e0114526de557568180?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 29?><?image-scaled-width 9?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/f7ebc8c41dab/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq71.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq71.gif?><?thumb-size 129?><?thumb-md5 f7ebc8c41dab5e0114526de557568180?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 29?><?thumb-scaled-width 9?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/f7ebc8c41dab/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq71.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula> at time <inline-formula id="IEq72"><alternatives><tex-math id="M161"><?equation-image-name M161.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 391609a27f82f32ab01d56e0381b9eaa?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/391609a27f82/M161.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$t$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M162"><mml:mi>t</mml:mi></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq72.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq72.gif?><?image-size 127?><?image-md5 a9ec1de4f07d4138723851503cd41823?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 29?><?image-scaled-width 9?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/a9ec1de4f07d/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq72.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq72.gif?><?thumb-size 127?><?thumb-md5 a9ec1de4f07d4138723851503cd41823?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 29?><?thumb-scaled-width 9?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/a9ec1de4f07d/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq72.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula> was computed from the raw fluorescence data extracted from the final 100 min of the acquired single-cell fluorescence signals. Specifically, the raw fluorescence values for all the cells were aggregated together in a single dataset, and then a mixture of two normal distributions was fitted on the histogram of this dataset. The threshold level was chosen as the intersection point of the two normal distributions. Next, the single-cell binary signal was checked to detect the last binary transition. This can be an on to off (<inline-formula id="IEq73"><alternatives><tex-math id="M163"><?equation-image-name M163.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 1d8e9857016c878b1f0f38cb61a661e4?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/1d8e9857016c/M163.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$${\rm{on}}\to {\rm{off}}$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M164"><mml:mi mathvariant="normal">on</mml:mi><mml:mo>→</mml:mo><mml:mi mathvariant="normal">off</mml:mi></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq73.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq73.gif?><?image-size 1729?><?image-md5 9a76a3b1e58c523e1df5bf05e5b75146?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 80?><?image-scaled-width 178?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/9a76a3b1e58c/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq73.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq73.gif?><?thumb-size 1729?><?thumb-md5 9a76a3b1e58c523e1df5bf05e5b75146?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 80?><?thumb-scaled-width 178?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/9a76a3b1e58c/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq73.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula>) transition, corresponding to the start of the unbudded phase; or an off to on (<inline-formula id="IEq74"><alternatives><tex-math id="M165"><?equation-image-name M165.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 8010413cf2e8366d01ae089c16a6bf45?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/8010413cf2e8/M165.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$${\rm{off}}\to {\rm{on}}$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M166"><mml:mi mathvariant="normal">off</mml:mi><mml:mo>→</mml:mo><mml:mi mathvariant="normal">on</mml:mi></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq74.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq74.gif?><?image-size 1731?><?image-md5 5085e293e72f13a9aeb86f18c46c8b22?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 80?><?image-scaled-width 178?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/5085e293e72f/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq74.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq74.gif?><?thumb-size 1731?><?thumb-md5 5085e293e72f13a9aeb86f18c46c8b22?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 80?><?thumb-scaled-width 178?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/5085e293e72f/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq74.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula>) transition, corresponding to the start of the budded phase. Assuming that the last transition occurred at time <inline-formula id="IEq75"><alternatives><tex-math id="M167"><?equation-image-name M167.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 aa8c46b79740406f6cdf22a70037850c?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/aa8c46b79740/M167.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$t-{T}_{t}$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M168"><mml:mi>t</mml:mi><mml:mo>−</mml:mo><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mi>T</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mi>t</mml:mi></mml:mrow></mml:msub></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq75.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq75.gif?><?image-size 229?><?image-md5 9e3c5240504f3e01313b8705fb79130c?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 29?><?image-scaled-width 42?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/9e3c5240504f/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq75.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq75.gif?><?thumb-size 229?><?thumb-md5 9e3c5240504f3e01313b8705fb79130c?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 29?><?thumb-scaled-width 42?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/9e3c5240504f/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq75.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula>, the estimated cell cycle phase <inline-formula id="IEq76"><alternatives><tex-math id="M169"><?equation-image-name M169.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 e4cdf98b29702f18c1bb63c2d18c0cb5?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/e4cdf98b2970/M169.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
