				\begin{document}$$R$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M228"><mml:mi>R</mml:mi></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq100.gif"><?image-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq100.gif?><?image-size 158?><?image-md5 41ee29614678fe697b91f1fa512f92da?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 15?><?image-scaled-width 15?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/41ee29614678/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq100.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq100.gif?><?thumb-size 158?><?thumb-md5 41ee29614678fe697b91f1fa512f92da?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 15?><?thumb-scaled-width 15?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/41ee29614678/41467_2021_22689_Article_IEq100.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula> is equal to 1, all cells are synchronised. Conversely, when <inline-formula id="IEq101"><alternatives><tex-math id="M229"><?equation-image-name M229.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 dc3eae884ab8d5b20ab952b6ba821ccd?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/4187/8079375/dc3eae884ab8/M229.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
