89_MOESM7_ESM.mp4?><caption><p>Supplementary Movie 3</p></caption></media></supplementary-material><supplementary-material content-type="local-data" id="MOESM8" position="float" orientation="portrait"><media xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_MOESM8_ESM.mp4" position="float" orientation="portrait"><?suppdata-name 41467_2021_22689_MOESM8_ESM.mp4?><?suppdata-size 27646338?><?suppdata-md5 88437d495074016f19661d11dd4d470e?><?suppdata-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?suppdata-mime-type video?><?suppdata-mime-sub-type mp4?><?suppdata-cloudpmc-urn urn:app:4187/8079375/88437d495074/41467_2021_22689_MOESM8_ESM.mp4?><caption><p>Supplementary Movie 4</p></caption></media></supplementary-material><supplementary-material content-type="local-data" id="MOESM9" position="float" orientation="portrait"><media xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_MOESM9_ESM.mp4" position="float" orientation="portrait"><?suppdata-name 41467_2021_22689_MOESM9_ESM.mp4?><?suppdata-size 68764427?><?suppdata-md5 a85896e256b10a09bf43f67100e0c6c8?><?suppdata-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?suppdata-mime-type video?><?suppdata-mime-sub-type mp4?><?suppdata-cloudpmc-urn urn:app:4187/8079375/a85896e256b1/41467_2021_22689_MOESM9_ESM.mp4?><caption><p>Supplementary Movie 5</p></caption></media></supplementary-material><supplementary-material content-type="local-data" id="MOESM10" position="float" orientation="portrait"><media xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_MOESM10_ESM.mp4" position="float" orientation="portrait"><?suppdata-name 41467_2021_22689_MOESM10_ESM.mp4?><?suppdata-size 65917204?><?suppdata-md5 b4b8c30a3e755a66749e8010cab58815?><?suppdata-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?suppdata-mime-type video?><?suppdata-mime-sub-type mp4?><?suppdata-cloudpmc-urn urn:app:4187/8079375/b4b8c30a3e75/41467_2021_22689_MOESM10_ESM.mp4?><caption><p>Supplementary Movie 6</p></caption></media></supplementary-material><supplementary-material content-type="local-data" id="MOESM11" position="float" orientation="portrait"><media xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2021_22689_MOESM11_ESM.pdf" position="float" orientation="portrait"><?suppdata-name 41467_2021_22689_MOESM11_ESM.pdf?><?suppdata-size 329978?><?suppdata-md5 8db1504d5caf4abc096404f141382977?><?suppdata-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?suppdata-mime-type application?><?suppdata-mime-sub-type pdf?><?suppdata-cloudpmc-urn urn:app:4187/8079375/8db1504d5caf/41467_2021_22689_MOESM11_ESM.pdf?><caption><p>Reporting Summary</p></caption></media></supplementary-material></sec></sec></body><back><fn-group><fn><p><bold>Peer review information</bold>
<italic toggle="yes">Nature Communications</italic> thanks Filippo Menolascina and the other, anonymous, reviewer(s) for their contribution to the peer review of this work. Peer reviewer reports are available.</p></fn><fn><p><bold>Publisher’s note</bold> Springer Nature remains neutral with regard to jurisdictional claims in published maps and institutional affiliations.</p></fn><fn><p>These authors contributed equally: Giansimone Perrino, Sara Napolitano.</p></fn></fn-group><sec><title>Supplementary information</title><p>The online version contains supplementary material available at 10.1038/s41467-021-22689-w.</p></sec><ack><title>Acknowledgements</title><p>The authors would like to thank Sahand Jamal Rahi (EPFL, Switzerland) for the SJR14a4d <italic toggle="yes">S. cerevisiae</italic> strain (i.e. the non-cycling strain), Gilles Charvin (IGBMC, France) for the GC84-35B <italic toggle="yes">S. cerevisiae</italic> strain (i.e. background of the cycling strain), Cathal Wilson (TIGEM, Italy) for the insightful help with strain construction and for the plasmid pRS41N-GAP-CYC, Ciro Talotti (TIGEM, Italy) for help with media preparation, and Jeff Hasty (UCSD, USA) for the master mould of the microfluidic device. This work was supported by the Fondazione Telethon grant TGM16SB1 and by the COSY-BIO (Control Engineering of Biological Systems for Reliable Synthetic Biology Applications) project, which has received funding from the European Union’s Horizon 2020 research and innovation programme under grant agreement 766840.</p></ack><notes notes-type="author-contribution"><title>Author contributions</title><p>G.P., S.N. and D.d.B. designed the research; G.P. developed and supervised the controllers’ designs, modelling and experiments; S.N. performed the experiments and developed image analysis and phase estimation algorithms; F.G. and A.L.R. equally contributed to the research; F.G. helped to design the controller strategies and the phase estimation algorithms; A.L.R. helped to perform experiments, image analysis and modelling; D.F. helped to develop the stop&amp;go controller and the cell cycle model; T.G. engineered the cycling yeast strain; M.d.B. helped in controllers’ design and modelling; G.P., S.N. and D.d.B. analysed the data; D.d.B. proposed the concept and supervised the project; G.P., S.N. and D.d.B. wrote the manuscript.</p></notes><notes notes-type="data-availability"><title>Data availability</title><p>The authors declare that the data supporting the findings of this study are available within the paper and its <xref rid="MOESM1" ref-type="media">Supplementary Information</xref> files. Source data for Figs. <xref rid="Fig2" ref-type="fig">2</xref>–<xref rid="Fig4" ref-type="fig">4</xref> and Supplementary Figs. <xref rid="MOESM1" ref-type="media">1</xref>–<xref rid="MOESM1" ref-type="media">9</xref> are provided at <ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="https://github.com/dibbelab/Cycloop">https://github.com/dibbelab/Cycloop</ext-link><sup><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="CR49">49</xref></sup>. The microscopy data have been deposited in Zenodo, 10.5281/zenodo.4516319. Strains and plasmids used in this study are available from the corresponding author upon reasonable request.</p></notes><notes notes-type="data-availability"><title>Code availability</title><p>The source code that supports the findings of this study is available from GitHub at <ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="https://github.com/dibbelab/Cycloop">https://github.com/dibbelab/Cycloop</ext-link><sup><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="CR49">49</xref></sup>.</p></notes><notes id="FPar1" notes-type="COI-statement"><title>Competing interests</title><p id="Par54">The authors declare no competing interests.</p></notes><ref-list id="Bib1"><title>References</title><ref id="CR1"><label>1.</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name name-style="western"><surname>Li</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name name-style="western"><surname>Long</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name name-style="western"><surname>Lu</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name name-style="western"><surname>Ouyang</surname><given-names>Q</given-names></name><name name-style="western"><surname>Tang</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The yeast cell-cycle network is robustly designed</article-title><source>Proc. Natl Acad. Sci. USA</source><year>2004</year><volume>101</volume><fpage>4781 LP</fpage><lpage>4786</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1073/pnas.0305937101</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15037758</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmcid">PMC387325</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="CR2"><label>2.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="other">Morgan, D. O. <italic toggle="yes">The Cell Cycle: Principles of Control</italic> (New Science Press, 2007).</mixed-citation></ref><ref id="CR3"><label>3.</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name name-style="western"><surname>Hartwell</surname><given-names>LH</given-names></name><name name-style="western"><surname>Unger</surname><given-names>MW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Unequal division in Saccharomyces cerevisiae and its implications for the control of cell division</article-title><source>J. Cell Biol.</source><year>1977</year><volume>75</volume><fpage>422</fpage><lpage>435</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1083/jcb.75.2.422</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">400873</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmcid">PMC2109951</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="CR4"><label>4.</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name name-style="western"><surname>Dirick</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name name-style="western"><surname>Böhm</surname><given-names>T</given-names></na